@startuml
title Observability - Trace Span Lifecycle
hide empty description
[*] --> STARTED_DOC : startSpan()
STARTED_DOC --> ACTIVE_DOC : makeCurrent()
ACTIVE_DOC --> ACTIVE_DOC : tag(...)
ACTIVE_DOC --> ERROR_RECORDED_DOC : error(Throwable)
ERROR_RECORDED_DOC --> ACTIVE_DOC : span remains closable
ACTIVE_DOC --> CLOSED_DOC : close()
CLOSED_DOC --> CLOSED_DOC : repeated close ignored by OtelTraceSpanImpl
CLOSED_DOC --> [*]

state "STARTED [DOC MODEL]" as STARTED_DOC
state "ACTIVE [DOC MODEL]" as ACTIVE_DOC
state "ERROR_RECORDED [DOC MODEL]" as ERROR_RECORDED_DOC
state "CLOSED [DOC MODEL]" as CLOSED_DOC

note right
ITraceSpan 没有公开状态枚举。
OtelTraceSpanImpl 使用 AtomicBoolean 保证 close 幂等，
close 顺序是 Scope.close() -> Span.end()。
end note
@enduml
